WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:08.380
Our Pacific Beach Wellgreens is located
at 4645 De Soto Street, just off

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.260
the 5 freeway at Garnet.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.380
We are open from 6 a.m.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.260
to 9:55 p.m.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.460
seven days a week.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:16.660
See you soon.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.940
At Wellgreens, great customer service
starts with having knowledgeable, friendly

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.760
team members at every location.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.080
I've been in the industry since 2010.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.900
Many of our employees bring years of
experience from different parts of the

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.860
industry. That knowledge and experience
help our customers feel confident and

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:40.940
comfortable with the recommendations
they receive while shopping.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.860
Please come see us in Pacific Beach.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.100
We would love to take care of you.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:49.600
Thank you. I would say I

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:54.900
enjoy that we get so many people from
so many different backgrounds and

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.260
cultures and stuff like that
because we're right by the beach.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:01.820
So we just get so many different types
of tourists here, be able to meet so many

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:02.640
different people.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:06.080
I also love that it's super
family-oriented over here.

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.700
I feel like I'm working with all
my cousins, so it's really fun.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.560
Yeah, I love living at the
beach and then working here.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.600
It's a really good sense of community
where I get to see my local Trader Joe's

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.840
receptionists and people working at Vons.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:24.120
And I not only see them here, but I see
them walking down the street and they bring

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:24.940
their dogs in.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:27.080
So it's a really good community aspect.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:29.640
And like she said, we're all family here.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:30.720
So it's really fun.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:46.220
Just like all of our other locations,
Pacific Beach has an amazing clearance area

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:50.080
with items up to 70% off
every day of the week.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.280
Come take a look.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:54.800
You will definitely get some of the best
deals you're going to find in the industry.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.860
We're also proud to announce that over
the next six months, we're going to be

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:06.260
launching another delivery hub here from
our Pacific Beach location, giving us the

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:09.900
opportunity to bring the Wellgreens
experience to more of the coastal communities

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:10.900
here in San Diego.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.120
Thank you and we will talk to you soon.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:21.100
All of our customers in Pacific Beach will
agree the self-serve shopping model is

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:25.360
amazing. They enjoy being able to take
their time and shop at their leisure.

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:27.000
Thanks for joining us guys.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.240
That's a look at our
Pacific Beach location.

